products like face creams, moisturizers, serums, and face masks.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Haircare products like hair oils, serums, hair masks, conditioners, hair spray.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">In aromatherapy, as massage blends, diffuser blends, and incense sticks.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">In DIY as scented candles, soaps, etc.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Domestic usage, such as room fresheners, natural cleaners, and in perfumery.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Benefits</span></h2>\r\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1. For skincare</span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Provides hydration and nourishment to the skin.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Reduces acne and breakouts by reducing oil secretion.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Gives anti-aging effects and helps in the healing of scars.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Enhances natural glow and rejuvenates skin.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">2. For haircare</span></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Helps with hair thickening to prevent hair fall.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Boost the growth of hair by enhancing circulation to the scalp.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Strengthen the hair shaft and reduce dandruff.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p 